[
  {
    "id": "q1",
    "text": "避难点排队领物资，排到一半有人顺口问接下来往哪走，我多半会接一句，而不只是点头过去。",
    "scene": "避难点·队伍里",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 2,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": -2,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q2",
    "text": "天灾预警一响，屋里的嘈杂让我更想找个高处自己看云、看风向，而不是挤在人群里等二手消息。",
    "scene": "预警夜·屋顶",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": -1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": 1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q3",
    "text": "候诊区冷场、没人吭声时，我可能会先扯两句天气或不相干的闲话，把气氛从冻住的状态里撬开一点。",
    "scene": "地下诊所·候诊区",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 1,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": -2,
      "healer": -1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q4",
    "text": "外勤跑了一天回驻点，我习惯先冲个热水、发会儿呆，再慢慢跟人聊路上遇见的事。",
    "scene": "信使驻点·回屋",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": -1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": 1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q5",
    "text": "登车口挤成一团时，我容易忍不住站出去喊一嗓子、把人分成两队——哪怕其实没人派我管。",
    "scene": "移动城邦·登车口",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 2,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": -2,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q6",
    "text": "对着旧报纸和口述记录，我更喜欢先把字条贴满墙、自己理顺，再拿出去跟人讨论。",
    "scene": "档案库·旧报纸角落",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": -1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": 1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q7",
    "text": "在陌生街区临时借仓、借车或借人手，我往往是先开口问价、问条件的那个人。",
    "scene": "龙门街区·临时搭话",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 2,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": -2,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q8",
    "text": "长途车上要是全程聊天，我会比堵车还累；中间留两段不说话，反而更自在。",
    "scene": "荒原驿路·长途车厢",
    "dimension": "E_I",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": -1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": 1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q9",
    "text": "新闻播到一半被掐断，或有人话说一半打住，我会老惦记没讲完的那截。",
    "scene": "卡兹戴尔·旧闻片段",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": -1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q10",
    "text": "别人聊国际大势、年代转折时，我脑子转的还是：药够不够、明天能不能出工。",
    "scene": "矿区日常·补给清点",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": 2,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q11",
    "text": "听到移动城邦、天灾安全带这类词，我常会联想到更长的历史、别处的相似故事。",
    "scene": "泰拉常识·课堂与地图",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": -1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q12",
    "text": "真出事的时候，我本能是先摸能摸到的东西：止血、封路、清人，而不是先开会辩个明白。",
    "scene": "汐斯塔季风·现场处置",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": 2,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q13",
    "text": "酒桌上那句玩笑、多停的那半拍，我总会下意识猜：是不是还有半句没说。",
    "scene": "酒馆闲谈·话外之音",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": -1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q14",
    "text": "做判断前，我更想有能复核的东西：数字、亲眼所见、试纸或记录，而不是笼统的预感。",
    "scene": "边境哨站·风险研判",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": 2,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q15",
    "text": "几方说法互相打架时，我会想把碎片摆全，宁可多绕一点路，也想拼出能解释得通的版本。",
    "scene": "维多利亚·多线消息",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": 0,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": -1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q16",
    "text": "手头紧的时候，我优先保住一日三餐、睡眠和还能运转的节奏，别的事往后排。",
    "scene": "灾后集市·紧缺配给",
    "dimension": "S_N",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": 2,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 1,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -1,
      "ruler": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q17",
    "text": "卡在两种都不好的选择里，我习惯先把得失、最坏情形写在纸上，再谈心里过不过得去。",
    "scene": "封锁区抉择·两难当下",
    "dimension": "T_F",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": -2,
      "berserker": 1,
      "trickster": 0,
      "ruler": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q18",
    "text": "只要想到名单上是一个个具体的人，我就很难用“总数划算”来说服自己牺牲谁。",
    "scene": "感染者站台·名单筛选",
    "dimension": "T_F",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": -2,
      "guardian": 2,
      "lonewolf": -1,
      "healer": 2,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": 0,
      "ruler": -1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q19",
    "text": "听方案时，我会先抠字眼、抠流程会不会卡住，不太在乎是谁站台上讲。",
    "scene": "公听会现场·方案争执",
    "dimension": "T_F",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": -2,
      "berserker": 1,
      "trickster": 0,
      "ruler": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q20",
    "text": "看见人在眼前难受，我往往先被那种难受拽住，原则要晚一步才进脑子。",
    "scene": "矿石病病房·陪护时刻",
    "dimension": "T_F",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": -2,
      "guardian": 2,
      "lonewolf": -1,
      "healer": 2,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": 0,
      "ruler": -1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q21",
    "text": "快吵起来的时候，我更想当场把利害摊在桌上，就算难听，也不想用客气话把雷埋深。",
    "scene": "街区协商·冲突升级前",
    "dimension": "T_F",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": -2,
      "berserker": 1,
      "trickster": 0,
      "ruler": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q22",
    "text": "同伴翻脸时，我总想先把人拉回到能说话的距离，再掰扯谁对谁错。",
    "scene": "同伴摩擦·夜间和解",
    "dimension": "T_F",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": -2,
      "guardian": 2,
      "lonewolf": -1,
      "healer": 2,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": 0,
      "ruler": -1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q23",
    "text": "只要推得动的逻辑还在，外界一时骂两句，我通常不会为了面子改结论。",
    "scene": "传言风暴·独立判断",
    "dimension": "T_F",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 2,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 2,
      "healer": -2,
      "berserker": 1,
      "trickster": 0,
      "ruler": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q24",
    "text": "出门前一晚，我会把路线、补给、换洗衣服和药塞进包，少一样心里就不踏实。",
    "scene": "远行前夜·背包与路线",
    "dimension": "J_P",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 1,
      "guardian": 1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -2,
      "ruler": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q25",
    "text": "路上突然冒出更好的线索或更糟的风险，我反而愿意改道，不想硬着头皮按旧表走。",
    "scene": "荒野搭车·半途改线",
    "dimension": "J_P",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": 2,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": -2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q26",
    "text": "事情悬着不收尾，我会一直惦记；有个确定的说法，哪怕不好听，也比悬着强。",
    "scene": "债务与工期·未结案",
    "dimension": "J_P",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 1,
      "guardian": 1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -2,
      "ruler": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q27",
    "text": "我接受计划存在，但真走起来还是喜欢留白：边走边看，临时起意拐个弯也不碍事。",
    "scene": "自由行脚·边走边看",
    "dimension": "J_P",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": 2,
      "trickster": 2,
      "ruler": -2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q28",
    "text": "信息再怎么缺，我也想先立个粗糙的规矩：谁负责、先干什么，再跟着补细节。",
    "scene": "小队拼车·先定分工",
    "dimension": "J_P",
    "sign": 1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 0,
      "strategist": 1,
      "guardian": 1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
      "healer": 0,
      "berserker": -1,
      "trickster": -2,
      "ruler": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "q29",
    "text": "乱成一团时，我反而清醒，临时凑一套办法，比提前写满三十页管用。",
    "scene": "突发天候·即时反应",
    "dimension": "J_P",
    "sign": -1,
    "weights": {
      "hero": 1,
      "strategist": -1,
      "guardian": -1,
      "lonewolf": 0,
